;
; How Graft files one commit of a folder's history in MYRA (graft_rules.h
; GR5): under its number, the number of the commit before it (0 for the
; first), its author (the household's number for the person, never a
; name), its time (seconds since 1970) and its message's length in bytes.
; The model asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps the commit.
^ZXGRAFT(commit:i9) = parent:i9! ^ author:i6! ^ stamp:i11! ^ msglen:i4!
